      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACQUI MOSS (1) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her powerful 28.11 win at Bendigo over 500m. Can return to winning form here if runs up to time two back. DIME A DOZEN (2) three runs back produced a strong 17.35 win over 313m at Wanganui Straight then has found the minor money in two runs since. Should be in this for a long way. FOXY BARBELLA (6) turned in a better effort at Ballarat last start, finishing third behind Blue Storm (31.50) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to feature again. OPALITE (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
